    "1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:fbcbf2d5c38d2b794a2cebb08538b7989ec31cb984aa19dc0b67f9181295b856",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_0:1_5_002_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ステージを最高に盛り上げてくるからさ！\nだって僕が出るんだよ？　当然でしょ！",
        "text": "我会让舞台气氛嗨到最顶点的！\n毕竟是我出场嘛？理所当然的吧！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:180a590a36507ce116ccb04adf9b2b2d444279c9032b6769da13173d95a85973",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_0:1_5_002_00_0:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:fca466f1514f3980ae452c66d5427ef48dda6fa3af117a794cb9656b51b3c6b4",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_1:1_5_003_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "俺を見てくれる人、全員を虜にするつもりで\n臨んできますよ☆",
        "text": "抱着要把所有看着我的人都迷倒的决心，\n去迎战吧☆",
        "source_hash": "sha256:efa3d6ff960642aa44c5b865f224a7c71b1c88c50009a4ce839dddaa5496a7fd",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_1:1_5_003_00_1:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_003hok_1_5_003_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:c123d6819fc142ee59a22c3b5d275a9e388e58edea57e7c0955de9b613f44230",
      "title": 189,
      "opening": {
        "source": "一般の方をコーディネートする機会なんて\nなかなか無いので楽しみです。",
        "text": "给普通人搭配服装的机会\n可不多见，真让人期待。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:fc3b2f02ec394fd7048d15d9c138e78780bc37547572d40ca775cafa604fa2dc",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_04:1_5_003_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_004ter_1_5_004_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:39dacd6597e4bf7c32900de662ecc1431f1016e15b9eaa0dfafe759657df01a0",
      "title": 192,
      "opening": {
        "source": "お疲れさまです、輝さん。\n休憩を挟んで後半戦ですね。",
        "text": "辛苦了，辉先生。\n休息过后就是后半场了呢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:839815832bb8794aa654d3399cccdd9df31fc125b5d87cf2de5d8bbd3b36dfc5",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_004ter_1_5_004_03:1_5_004_03:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:62fdb9af0c74222154159d898f00502479828f2c24c23731d81615a4e56c6cf5",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_5:1_5_006_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "とっても楽しいステージでした！\nファンの方の声援があったおかげですね！",
        "text": "是个非常开心的舞台呢！\n多亏了粉丝们的加油声！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:193391602416f38682ab463f4867bc91ba2875b26725f821c25d58ce36cf40a9",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_5:1_5_006_00_5:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_007kei_1_5_007_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:75d99ddef57de32bed1bcb8ecc7af005afea38b9515208e32d8326945b504beb",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_007kei_1_5_007_00_8:1_5_007_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "歌うのにも踊るのにも体力が必要だから……\n身体を動かす習慣をつけないといけないかな？",
        "text": "无论是唱歌还是跳舞都需要体力呢……\n我是不是得养成锻炼身体的习惯才行呢？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:fe4373464cf748843fb79a71869e16a75b7602f778443f3ee345fcd1cbd38a0d",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_007kei_1_5_007_00_8:1_5_007_00_8:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:6c1efde2dd1a0449eabba7439c9b18ec16056ba3150cb85d4595c80130d39f85",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_1:1_5_008_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日もわたし達の音楽を\n沢山のファンに届けてこよう。",
        "text": "今天也去把我们的音乐\n传达给广大粉丝吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2441c340f8d9d8cbb5ef136e4d8107ae6d2d609e4cfcfad9f0d6ce6ddf45a8b0",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_1:1_5_008_00_1:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:ff03fbfb26092c6c984e95fccadb1f69d3c5f093c48975ab8616f18337e009fb",
      "title": 209,
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日は動物番組の、犬のしつけ企画の収録だな。",
        "text": "今天是动物节目的训狗企划录制吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:7a4fa07901e16fbae4c1ba5be56e55fa7edfe3c81b819694c2e68ce2d44ac25b",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:432ef7ed197b1995edd6f5b405ce411aa65384781f3cb1054be0a7904afd603e",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_1:1_5_011_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ファンの嬉しそうな姿を見ると、\nアイドルになってよかったって心から思うよ。",
        "text": "看到粉丝们开心的样子，\n我就会由衷地庆幸自己成为了偶像啊。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bfb6747b6f20427155eb9dd5965682a15d9a7b2c55a3366e3f770abfbe69c631",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_1:1_5_011_00_1:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_011min_1_5_011_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:3781e127f672e7f6b323926a136f4ff87e2a424828329642ec7ddd122dee96d9",
      "title": 221,
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサー、\nここにいたんだね。待たせちゃってごめん。",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n你在这里啊。让你久等了抱歉。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:25cd149c0af5c63fc3a75218c95d251c4774e77082cb216ea6d4ec1497fc6515",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_04:1_5_011_04:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:f1e8c0a8b9845cc7940836dbde02328c75859887d47ab3a7a30bfc2f21d66764",
      "title": 222,
      "opening": {
        "source": "悠介さん、お疲れさまです。\n今、お時間大丈夫ですか？",
        "text": "悠介先生，辛苦了。\n现在有时间吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:9f98760d885e9dd9c84ba46be8a48c7710014123e512595a88d70f01c4f8a73b",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:98bab1367556772a3af603230b1104b73e824394e479634439a3bf62de428a25",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_0:1_5_013_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "収録用の台本を読んでたんだけど、気になるとこが\nあってさ……一緒に確認してくれるかな？",
        "text": "我刚才在读录制用的剧本，有几个在意的\n地方……能陪我一起确认一下吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:82e839dbe125554bc5e6b7db3fbc719471286d7c4a1c01837e922b386c351451",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_0:1_5_013_00_0:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:9819b54ca716566516d959ac178f343e923184f13cac91a955362efef4648b68",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_6:1_5_014_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "どんな仕事だろうが、俺がやることは決まってる。\nだから安心して任せてくれよ、プロデューサー！",
        "text": "不管是什么工作，我该做的事都很明确。\n所以放心交给我吧，制作人！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:92103428941f9a932caf62b26509fa95901e086e98783545be3f30817f0de145",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_6:1_5_014_00_6:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:8371b395f85e7dd326acef49e610b914f31970ce29db83162ac3b8e5e338b348",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_5:1_5_015_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "あのスタッフさんが持ってる脚立、重そうだな。\n俺ちょっと、運ぶの手伝ってくる！",
        "text": "那个工作人员拿的折叠梯，看起来好重啊。\n我去帮他一起搬！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:087bfac0e8a4ec7bf454c602ebc19963e85f3f741fc03103c178e72c8392784e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_5:1_5_015_00_5:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:dac4d93305bd865f79e23187836cc6309c9e5bb0b9067071e7bb2b86e2f57bda",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_0:1_5_016_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日も、ファンの笑顔が溢れるような\nそんなステージにしてみせるよ。",
        "text": "今天我也要呈现出能让粉丝们\n满脸笑容的舞台给大家看。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:60a58264790031d9d3e563c0c44999ecf241030ba4d39b30b76d30530226e377",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_0:1_5_016_00_0:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:4b98af5c702e68e7bb8420aa350da981eeb76036cabd802de933f7f44ddaf60c",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_3:1_5_017_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "次の仕事まで時間があるからして、\n一緒にお話しするでにゃんす♪",
        "text": "距离下一份工作还有时间，\n一起聊聊天喵♪",
        "source_hash": "sha256:754b8ffd3b1be5c629b03117973c8640149d3c88936faa4dd5ce5bb0e6518b51",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_3:1_5_017_00_3:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_017kir_1_5_017_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:6a30e9538cd7e30b1c5a8dac0dde7b7528866678368baa0395ce364856a3c5ea",
      "title": 243,
      "opening": {
        "source": "にゃにゃっにゃ～ん。\nにゃ～にゃにゃ、にゃんにゃん～♪",
        "text": "喵喵喵～。\n喵～喵喵，喵喵～♪",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c5e6f27bd6c5691a4f4f6b5ba5eded71ccadee44c39310d4db24bf8ac2604a00",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_02:1_5_017_02:cmd-000021:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:ae5704cc09a8718370024d4ac5fd0c004a450ef52f804fe25d9fe794e5505b98",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_5:1_5_018_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日も気張っていくよ！　315プロダクションの\n華村翔真ここにありって言わせてくるから。",
        "text": "今天也要大显身手哦！我要让大家感叹，\n315 Production的华村翔真就在这里呢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:1eaf4db51b885f873de2018469c514f4f7aa7ac5557ab241aa86405591a62204",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_5:1_5_018_00_5:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:de336134946c8e35c2ccc37c63e9efd08078623233b90e6fb9bc7ebb143cd606",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_3:1_5_020_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "お疲れさまでした！\n思いっきりギター弾けて、楽しかった～！",
        "text": "辛苦啦！\n能尽情弹吉他，太开心了～！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:be4aa5a2c3ee21b096eb5d3ab38a25c383b9ef0e3a347933837f2a1328e0fbff",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_3:1_5_020_00_3:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_020hay_1_5_020_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:c6c4ec97d807071d1e289ae28ddfe29a4a25e607845f51ddceb0c946eeb6b65a",
      "title": 255,
      "opening": {
        "source": "隼人さん、パンのキャンペーンCMのお仕事が\n決まりました！　こちらが資料になります。",
        "text": "隼人先生，面包促销广告的工作定下来了！\n这是相关资料。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:046f0b6c4c64658c29e816c5334c78caa02f35fbdd4591f50c6182b52daed4a2",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_020hay_1_5_020_02:1_5_020_02:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:2ca07248f2ebff1b699c7eacbd2a9f61b2f717201b941355eea3b84c94a24921",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_6:1_5_022_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "あ……これ、●●●●プロデューサーさんの\n差し入れ……？　ありがとう……。",
        "text": "啊……这是，●●●●プロデューサー送的\n慰劳品……？谢谢……",
        "source_hash": "sha256:8a7d744ae4fa6813ab85321e93522583f516a7ef7a58bacc435fe307d8a4ab9f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_6:1_5_022_00_6:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_023har_1_5_023_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:90ff08d2a13a28353fc45c2c7b9afc6e142a700aae0cca388862be717c51cc73",
      "title": 266,
      "opening": {
        "source": "これから缶コーヒーのCM撮影が始まるのか。\nついに……ついにこの時が来た！",
        "text": "接下来就要开始拍摄罐装咖啡的广告了吗？\n终于……终于等到这一刻了！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c54459edd4d751dfd03ffba0f25155107b1000bc12ebd58b01f72b70b67e31f9",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_023har_1_5_023_01:1_5_023_01:cmd-000020:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:eb6dca3b0f0b1626b27f28e4acbe9236dc2ab662f343105fccd4997ed708c157",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_1:1_5_024_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "オレ、アイドルメガメガ頑張るんで、\n次もスペシャルなお仕事よろしくっす☆",
        "text": "我当偶像会Mega Mega加油的，\n下次也拜托给我特别的工作啦☆",
        "source_hash": "sha256:60315c37be5cf30fcb59c2ffa952f09abf25f9cc5858469be2af5d482617a21b",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_1:1_5_024_00_1:cmd-000020:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:0ff96a979bbfb5dc7ca91a58186289c6df82e8ba296cb51bf623d22e1398a1d4",
      "title": 273,
      "opening": {
        "source": "「そんなに上手くいかないなら、少し休んだら？\n今のお前、全然楽しそうに見えない」",
        "text": "“要是那么不顺利，稍微休息一下怎么样？\n现在的你，看上去一点都不开心”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:039fd364d684cb8f8d070c016686429a572f8470a2cc73dfbd70e89870646447",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:53874037004dd46fa8ecb7009c53ab8cbc29a87e0e5987c4d7c3ab271313b8cb",
      "title": 282,
      "opening": {
        "source": "今回のロケの出発点はこの街か。\nここからバスを乗り継いで目的地を目指すんだね。",
        "text": "这次外景的起点是这座城市啊。\n从这里辗转搭乘巴士前往目的地对吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:b7e818aa38ecfbca26ffc721abfc3758a6ecf2020f9bf7a4d006d35bb2783423",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_01:1_5_027_01:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_028soi_1_5_028_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:42736a3025a2a856badc390408cd047aa0daf902201e8da265f93edf8c5173ab",
      "title": 286,
      "opening": {
        "source": "荘一郎さん、ラジオ番組にゲスト出演が\n決まりました！　こちらが台本になります。",
        "text": "庄一郎先生，确定让您客串出演\n广播节目了！这是台本。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:9beffbd146b882d16cc5c35e9938111eaf423486b88bfcbdd5904f7794b19c08",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_028soi_1_5_028_01:1_5_028_01:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_029ass_1_5_029_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:564768771b5b1b200503cd94d08750d889f3a4c71803118e6797bb26ae3ce67a",
      "title": 292,
      "opening": {
        "source": "『……ああ、嵐がやみ、舟が来るまで、\n俺たちはここから出ることができない』",
        "text": "“……啊，在暴风雨平息、小船驶来之前，\n我们都没法离开这里”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d0cce9937a5a895a4c26129a5507dbc5b2b818dc4a29b9023aea5e4ba5bd3774",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_029ass_1_5_029_03:1_5_029_03:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_030mak_1_5_030_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:c2b3ba6c59b22429bf8efa669dbf7af5028851de4c534498a45813941a579d00",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_030mak_1_5_030_00_8:1_5_030_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "Cafe Paradeのみんなとも一緒に、\nもっといろんな仕事をしてみたいです！",
        "text": "想和Cafe Parade的大家一起，\n尝试更多各种各样的工作呢！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:65f58e4b4c93064156da932c3ce33ead4909cf36662e10a487748b04b791f46a",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_030mak_1_5_030_00_8:1_5_030_00_8:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_031sak_1_5_031_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:d801beaa5d0972bd34ebdb3feb875677644a0d56e5305341e9afea7ce5dc62c2",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_00_8:1_5_031_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日の仕事もパピッと頑張ろー！\n●●●●プロデューサー、あたしのこと見ててね♪",
        "text": "今天的工作也要Papi地加油哦～！\n●●●●プロデューサー，要看好我哦♪",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d8501b1ac9ac97c19a8795e0e466f0b9304a3ca7de2bad1c5dec101ba7a69822",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_00_8:1_5_031_00_8:cmd-000019:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:80ebd4d19618a899180c214cf8f3925ac3eb365262a81d189ce69b95cf079758",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_1:1_5_032_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "リハーサルが始まる前に、\n共演者のみなさんに挨拶をしてきますね。",
        "text": "在彩排开始之前，\n我去向各位共演人员打个招呼。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bfdfca04679fb205e6e8da957964b5fc641bbe0dcc6ed16c537e1bb767cdd6cb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_1:1_5_032_00_1:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_032nao_1_5_032_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:3bfae486b65212b84a9f2ea9774c6f1db08ec799aac3a9641aaff482753667b0",
      "title": 305,
      "opening": {
        "source": "「わあ！　全然眼鏡をつけてる感じがしない！\nそれに遠くまではっきり見えるよ」",
        "text": "“哇！完全感觉不到戴了眼镜！\n而且连很远的地方都能看得很清楚哦”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:7a8f6d46e4c184b425b2229a0c00f700fac981b2ab44c1b1629aeb955b817405",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_032nao_1_5_032_04:1_5_032_04:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:13be62400179af13aa855417b8d1b94c81f555970b7cb15900006ad5fa8d3386",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_6:1_5_033_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！\nへへっ、これくらいどーってことねーよ。",
        "text": "One、Two、Three、Four！\n嘿嘿，这点动作根本不在话下啦。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bd3b14bc3b8fdb15ab62b15fd9fd9a6e8f7f581fb067dea56ae5b25510a8bd0f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_6:1_5_033_00_6:cmd-000019:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:cac754cb4b5fce151d29ee066b94ae2a6c4067d00ca86ff1e91ef059195ed4b2",
      "title": 314,
      "opening": {
        "source": "お待たせしました。\nこちらが先日採寸したスーツです。",
        "text": "让您久等了。\n这是前几天量身定做的西装。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:4544e8c5950bc6a05e4d7a23f1b732b104fec927108e1ee0033567c30228f13d",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:7120cf9c49e93c37a68620ef9e5c1ec8634594b05e1fa95bb6ea408f42e3b970",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_7:1_5_036_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "Yeah！　最っ高に盛り上がったね！\n楽しかった～☆",
        "text": "Yeah！气氛最——高潮了呢！\n太好玩啦～☆",
        "source_hash": "sha256:0578b6ed96ef933f7d7ccf59728ad5148b5eb9d0f046176f8e94cef755de805c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_7:1_5_036_00_7:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:a22743c42f723eaa25185edd76eb3794888d681f296a7912972290028bb47166",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_0:1_5_037_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "この衣装を着ると気が引き締まるねえ。\nさて、行ってきますか。",
        "text": "穿上这身服装，整个人就绷紧神经了呢。\n好啦，这就出发吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:a8a37c44e6ad898117a74d3ef66154ae296daf021ac3b1007b2bc0d56bb253e2",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_0:1_5_037_00_0:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:135339e71a3c41b9931b7c4a526576ecea3002599a409b68ba1a5993fbfe1725",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_3:1_5_038_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "最高のステージで、テッペンとってくる。\n行ってくるぜ、●●●●プロデューサー！",
        "text": "我会用最棒的舞台拿下顶峰回来的。\n我出发了，●●●●プロデューサー！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:dbf0b757ebbee89596161667fea51e31082467813d9824581642cc8f109d9f42",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_3:1_5_038_00_3:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_038tak_1_5_038_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:293cc92d6e661922d7e495589eb7de97906f8d61925d1cce063907fad65b35d2",
      "title": 327,
      "opening": {
        "source": "「キャプテンが怪我で出られないのがなんだ！\nそれが試合を諦める理由になんのか！？」",
        "text": "“队长因伤上不了场又怎样！\n这能成为放弃比赛的理由吗！？”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:adbc9324073ee41a59444029e3ed885bbede91a944bff9606c30de0dbf79eaee",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_038tak_1_5_038_02:1_5_038_02:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:d2bdd5109dab8c03e9d22c4a0ed57d2bddcac14aa8d780d0c1247b3c202d3f56",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_7:1_5_039_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "準備運動は念入りにしないと……。\n怪我をしたら大変ッスからね。",
        "text": "必须仔细做好热身运动才行……\n要是受伤可就麻烦了呢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:6b584922020657a281d2a1b4bf1d7adf955e312771159aae580a67dc56c229f1",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_7:1_5_039_00_7:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:12af2e61ca2583faee91246807cfc9e688ac19abe85e21795971acccaf2390a7",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_4:1_5_040_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "オレ様がチビなんかに負けるわけねェだろ？\nトーゼン、らーめん屋にもだ！",
        "text": "本大爷怎么可能会输给矮子？\n当然，也不会输给拉面店的！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:688487f76cb51ef181543381023ce4f0bb87df1611218e65de77f85ae1db8119",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_4:1_5_040_00_4:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:4fd29453e32fb568cbd2a8bd8aee62fba8f0b37f1c13e117739c80cb65e60002",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_1:1_5_041_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "僕を応援してくれるみんなのために\n今日もお仕事頑張ります！",
        "text": "为了所有支持我的大家，\n今天的工作我也要加油！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d104694e087796c37fd8e37b7d2af34dbf399dfc979f7633218ebec6463aebca",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_1:1_5_041_00_1:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:f6ff1a391a5bd7eda275758d07db1127d3d754d260e3da38f0dde4d76a98268e",
      "title": 341,
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサーさん、\nいよいよファンタジーミュージカルの開演ですよ！",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n奇幻音乐剧终于要开演了！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:689c24a7b3c25e90662560cee84aa368fc5426df4db40d1025158d7de228ab62",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_04:1_5_041_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:d88fdd6a59f67424141b32228abf8743de5dbb809230412ef72b175a087625bb",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_5:1_5_043_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "…新しくアウトドアショップが出来たらしい。\n時間があったら見に行ってもいいだろうか？",
        "text": "…听说新开了一家户外用品店。\n要是有时间的话，能去看看吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:5a15b8f18da4b36b6936b47af9aa69413a9c984dd5b20c8763b0dc7c77ca07e6",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_5:1_5_043_00_5:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_044ame_1_5_044_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:fd0ef5eecc9f1e91157f3e3ef727b35696ebe522e8a50dbaa24d230483dabfac",
      "title": 350,
      "opening": {
        "source": "雨彦さん、本日はファッション雑誌の\n衣装合わせになります。",
        "text": "雨彦先生，今天是要为时尚杂志\n试穿服装。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:047a4d36e17ce7ca0edf8b3480793a4e0e2f54287a43faf19c12bbbb9e7e5e93",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_01:1_5_044_01:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:e35ec6de32a2a4115a9ef83286cd70fc1cbfcd7f52f288ec026ad27f424072e5",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_6:1_5_046_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "よく海に潜っているので、\n体力にはかなり自信があります。",
        "text": "我经常下海潜水，\n所以对体力还是相当有自信的。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:5ee07e3317ef8e92632ac08a008128507c320668e72c3c2ef38ef0a6bf6c85c1",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_6:1_5_046_00_6:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:0272203ed5240bc2ba2998bd55f26221cbc67b8fcc35f2c1a0a98500efe60b79",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_5:1_5_047_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "台本が変更になった？　んー……大丈夫。\n本番直前だけど、これくらいすぐに覚えられるから。",
        "text": "台本改了？嗯——……没问题。\n虽然马上就要正式开拍了，但这点程度一下子就能背下来。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:8dcdbf0a2ba2720e4624d7c3fe2e811014a322b19f92859a08d9e1e422d5586d",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_5:1_5_047_00_5:cmd-000020:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:2756b0cbf1a64b14a0d5fc071369b001a30b332f08c5a686d5a91ed6cbee8b30",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_2:1_5_048_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "こんなにたくさんの歓声をもらえるなんて、\nアイドルってすごいね。",
        "text": "能收到这么多的欢呼声，\n偶像真的很厉害呢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:035a7d3b1783133d843f6aea97593c4a5c516553a3b2cfd7c515f4fc3b03d267",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_2:1_5_048_00_2:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_049eis_1_5_049_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:839253817d4237d4f867c9551c0718a0f9aac17929bfcfebf1a0ee8adab5d19c",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_00_0:1_5_049_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ステージは演者だけでは成り立ない。\nスタッフを含め、大勢の人間で作り上げるものだ。",
        "text": "舞台不能仅靠表演者成立。\n它是包括工作人员在内、由许多人共同打造出来的。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:4c8c97c838770d607123d723f53008c63c7ec63834e3b6388c1ea79a136cd9ee",
